text At the station right before noon...
text The weather is perfect.
text The blue sky is clear and refreshing, and the breeze feels pleasant.
text I would normally be asleep right now.
text Yet here I am, leaning against a pole and waiting for someone.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...A date, huh...?
text Now that I think about it, this would be the first time in my life that I go on a date...
text Since I'm the guy, I guess I'm going to have to treat.
text Actually, before I even think about that, where would we even go for a date?
text There aren't that many entertaining places around here.
text In any case, there's the shopping district right in front of me.
text Window shopping... huh?
text Well, I guess that's not bad seeing we'll find out what each other's tastes and interests are.
text @[Tomoya]
text It's nearly 11, huh?
text Talking to myself, I look at the station's clock.
text That reminds me. I wonder if Kyou'll be hiding somewhere to spy on us again.
text I bet she will.
text And I bet she would say it's to keep an eye on me so that I wouldn't do anything bad...
